        "description": "NE5532 dual op-amp preamplifier stage providing voltage gain (~100x-200x overall from input to output). This module uses one channel of the NE5532. Input signals connect to IN1_P/N differential pair; output is OUT1. The module is powered from VIN_9V (VCC_P) and shares GND (VCC_N). It provides a low-noise amplified signal to drive the power amplifier stage. Configure gain via external resistor network connected between OUT1, IN1_N, and IN1_P. This module owns the interface to the external audio input.",
